# Frontend build-time configuration.
#
#   copy .env.example .env
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables at build time. Nothing secret belongs here: every
# value below ends up in the JavaScript bundle a visitor downloads. Storage and
# database credentials live in backend/.env and are never exposed to React.

# Preview notice — a small banner above the header saying the catalog is not real.
#
# Leave it commented out for a real store: unset means the banner does not render
# at all. Set it only on a preview build, and remove it (then rebuild) to turn the
# banner off. It is not part of Vista Store's identity and must never be treated
# as permanent branding.
#
# VITE_PREVIEW_NOTICE=نسخة تجريبية — البيانات والأسعار للمعاينة
